    "intervention_model_description": "Prospective, double-blind, randomized study comparing the efficacy and safety of empagliflozin at doses of 10 and 25 mg in patients with HFpEF. The Kansas City Cardiomyopathy Questionnaire (KCCQ TSS) will be applied at inclusion and 8 weeks post-intervention in the two groups. And the use of echocardiogram performed upon entering the study, with assessment of ventricular and atrial strain modalities, and being repeated at the end of the treatment period to try to detect possible differences between pre and post treatment with the proposed ISGLT2.",
